        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On hell_key
    Take 379111000
    Teleport party to 33 at 62 91

On dragon_cave
    If player has 389200000
        Say "As you possess the [Marble of the Dragon] you are permitted entry into the Nest of the Fire Dragon. | Nest of the Fire Dragon is the habitat of Red Dragon, a monster incomparably powerful to previous monsters. If you are not prepared to put your life on the line as the bravest warrior of Adonis, you should not enter.|Do you want to enter Nest of the Fire Dragon?"
        Topic "go to the Dragon cave" do
            Take 389200000
            Teleport party to 34 at 112 15
        Topic "I will use it next time." goto close
    Else
        Say "You don't have the [Marble of the Dragon] which grants entry into the Nest of the Fire Dragon. You can obtain the marble from the subordinates of Isiloon."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On leave
    Teleport 30 at 500 250
